      "seed": 57,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 123456845,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1731580800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CI/CD Pipeline (cron_pipeline.sh):\n1. Fetch → Normalize → Metrics → Flows → Stats → Thesis → Export → Verify\n2. On verify PASS: commit artifacts, deploy to Vercel / Cloudflare Pages\n3. On verify FAIL: alert, retain previous artifacts, no deploy\n4. Static export → zero-server-cost hosting\n5. Data freshness: daily (live) / weekly (snapshot) / on-demand (synthetic)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CI/CD Pipeline (cron_pipeline.sh):\n1. Fetch → Normalize → Metrics → Flows → Stats → Thesis → Export → Verify\n2. On verify PASS: commit artifacts, deploy to Vercel / Cloudflare Pages\n3. On verify FAIL: alert, retain previous artifacts, no deploy\n4. Static export → zero-server-cost hosting\n5. Data freshness: daily (live) / weekly (snapshot) / on-demand (synthetic)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
